    "description": "Collection test cases cho module hlv_zalo_miniapp_api\n\nBase URL: https://<your-odoo-domain>\n\nAuth flow:\n1. Gọi POST /api/v1/zalo/contacts/auth để lấy token\n2. Dùng token trong header Authorization: Bearer <token>\n\nDev mode: secret mặc định \"hlv_zalo_dev_secret_2026\"",
